  m_text: 'Fixed enemy positioning issues during combat.


    Fixed enemies spawning
    partially underground.


    Restored the enemy selection circle in combat.


    Improved
    health bar visibility and death animations.


    Fixed keyboard and mouse input
    conflicts.


    Fixed inventory slot refill behavior.


    Fixed item usage
    cancellation and rejection messages.


    Improved combat accuracy and enemy
    outline settings.


    Updated and corrected environmental VFX.


    Improved
    audio settings and music transitions.


    Refined character models, textures,
    materials, and animations.'
