  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Combat UI & Health Bars


    Improved the combat HUD and introduced new
    color variations.


    Restored the enemy selection circle with corrected prefab
    and positioning.


    Added animated health bar trails:


    Yellow trails
    indicate damage.


    Green trails indicate healing.


    Health bar fills
    update immediately while their trails animate toward the new values.


    Ally
    health bars and the selected enemy''s health bar remain visible. Other enemy
    bars appear on hover or during animations.


    Health bars now finish their
    depletion animation when a character dies instead of disappearing immediately.


    Combat
    Effects & Behavior


    Added Token visual effects to character models.


    Added
    support for summons and Damage over Time (DoT) effects, including Bleed and Burn.


    Fixed
    enemies spawning partially underground.


    Improved enemy outline settings.


    Improved
    the combat environment and its visual effects.


    Characters & Combat Animations


    Added
    new Buck animations, including rifle and alternate revolver attacks.


    Fixed
    and refined Buck''s idle animations.


    Refined Wulfric''s model and animations.'
