  m_text: 'Input Improvements


    Fixed keyboard input handling to prevent conflicts
    with mouse input.


    Improved input behavior across the battle scene, main
    menu, and other game menus.


    Inventory & Item Interaction


    Added exact-slot
    item removal to prevent items from being removed from the wrong inventory location.


    Improved
    inventory slot ownership and click handling.


    Integrated the item usage
    flow into the Use buttons in the selected-item and transfer-item panels.


    Updated
    the Discard action to remove the item from its exact slot.


    Fixed an issue
    where removing an item from the temporary inventory could incorrectly refill
    multiple empty slots in the permanent inventory.


    Fixed item rejection messages
    disappearing during transitions between usage steps.


    Item Creation & Editor
    Tools


    Added editor tools to generate all 37 game items and the Intensity
    Library.


    Added a tool to create Restorative Drink assets.


    Added a
    tool to build the Item Use Flow interface and connect its required components
    without overwriting existing prefabs.


    Updated character stats and item
    effect test environments.'
