  m_text: 'Sound & Music Improvements


    Added interface sound effects.


    Added
    directional environmental audio and distance-based sound behavior.


    Improved
    audio pitch, music transitions, and audio source routing.


    Updated the Main
    Mixer routing to ensure sounds play through their appropriate audio categories,
    including dynamically generated ambient sounds.


    Improved village and exploration
    music transitions.'
