  m_text: 'Environment & Materials


    Updated the Corrupted Miner model, materials,
    and textures.


    Updated the Scavenger''s materials and textures.


    Improved
    combat environment visuals.


    Updated and corrected environmental visual
    effects.


    Improved materials and textures across the game.


    Character
    & Enemy Assets


    Added new proxy enemies: Extranger and Trap Chest.


    Refined
    the Wulfric model and animations.


    Updated the Buck model and animations.


    New
    & Updated Animations


    Corrupted Miner: Idle and Death cycles;


    Trap
    Chest: Idle cycle;


    Extranger: Attack,  Idle,  Hit Taken and Death cycles;


    Buck:
    New rifle attack animation;

    New alternate revolver attack animation;

    Idle
    animation fixes;


    Interface Visuals;


    Updated combat HUD colors.


    Added
    an animation to the Rewards Panel.


    Removed the game title from the Splash
    Screen.'
